WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:14.484
Hello! My name is Drizzle.

2
00:00:14.485 --> 00:00:18.150
I am a tiny water drop.

3
00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.732
Whew! The sun is heating me up!

4
00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:26.267
I am getting smaller and smaller.

5
00:00:26.268 --> 00:00:34.945
Oh! I am going up, up, up into a cloud! Whee!

6
00:00:34.946 --> 00:00:36.406
Look at them.

7
00:00:36.407 --> 00:00:40.616
They look just like me.

8
00:00:40.617 --> 00:00:43.063
It is really cool up here.

9
00:00:43.064 --> 00:00:46.341
I like this place.

10
00:00:46.342 --> 00:00:48.523
Hey! Look at me!

11
00:00:48.524 --> 00:00:51.759
I am getting bigger and bigger.

12
00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:55.432
Oh no! I am too big and heavy!

13
00:00:55.433 --> 00:00:58.912
I am falling from the sky!

14
00:00:58.913 --> 00:01:01.086
Where am I now?

15
00:01:01.087 --> 00:01:05.757
Oh I am in a river.

16
00:01:05.758 --> 00:01:08.754
My friends are falling onto the ground.

17
00:01:08.755 --> 00:01:12.973
They are seeping into the ground.

18
00:01:12.974 --> 00:01:16.843
Now this river is moving fast!

19
00:01:16.844 --> 00:01:25.234
Oh no! A waterfall!

20
00:01:25.235 --> 00:01:27.609
What is this place?

21
00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:33.916
Oh! I am being cleaned!

22
00:01:33.917 --> 00:01:36.131
It's dark in here.

23
00:01:36.132 --> 00:01:39.404
Where am I going now?

24
00:01:39.405 --> 00:01:46.484
Ohh! "Splash!" Wow! Here I am again!
